                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I was seated by the window despite having a reservation, but even with the curtains drawn, it was still directly in the sun, very hot and glaring. Our food took 50 minutes to arrive, while the customers who arrived later had already been served. When I inquired, it seemed they had forgotten to take our order. The fried rice was quite good, but the crab congee was tasteless. Most importantly, when I asked for wet wipes, the staff questioned me. Don\u0027t we need to wipe our hands after peeling crab legs? I asked for ice for my drink three times, but they never gave me any. I won\u0027t be coming back. 😡",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "有預約被安排坐窗邊，即使窗簾拉下來也跟太陽直射沒有差別，非常熱和刺眼，餐點等了50分鐘才來，隔壁晚來的都上餐了，詢問疑似是忘記做單，餐點部分炒飯蠻好吃的，螃蟹粥沒有味道，重點跟服務人員要濕紙巾時被置疑，請問吃剝螃蟹蟹腳不用擦手嗎？飲料去冰也問了三次，最後沒有去到冰，下次不會再來了😡",
